%% alt: Two pipelines. Indexing runs when sources change: parse and chunk, enrich and embed, then store in an index with keyword and vector entries and permissions. Querying runs on every request: rewrite the query, run keyword and vector search filtered by the caller's permissions, fuse and rerank the results, and generate an answer with citations.
flowchart TB
  subgraph Ingest[Indexing, on change]
    direction LR
    S[Sources]:::untrusted --> P[Parse, chunk]:::tool --> E[Enrich, embed]:::model --> I[(Index: keywords,<br/>vectors, permissions)]:::data
  end
  subgraph Query[Querying, every request]
    direction LR
    T[Rewrite query]:::model --> R[Hybrid search,<br/>caller's permissions]:::tool --> F[Fuse, rerank]:::model --> G[Generate<br/>with citations]:::model
  end
  Ingest -.->|searched by| Query
